            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n    <head prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb# fbwegottickets: http://ogp.me/ns/fb/fbwegottickets#\">\n        <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/>\n        <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"/>\n        <title>Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op presents:</title>\n\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/f/25577/\">\n        \n\n        <meta name=\"Description\" content=\"Buy tickets for music, comedy, theatre, film, festivals and much more - with the best service in UK ticketing\" />\n\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/skins/default/css/myfonts.webkit.css?updated=2025-08-12\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/skins/default/css/pocketgrid.min.css\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/skins/default/css/normalize.css?updated=2025-08-12\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"only screen and (max-width: 768px)\" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/css/menu.css\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/skins/default/css/skin.css?updated=2026-06-11g\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/skins/default/css/categories.css?updated=2025-08-12\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/skins/default/css/typography.css?updated=2025-08-12\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/slick.css\">\n\n        <noscript>\n            <style>\n                .features, .trending {\n                    display: none;\n                }\n            </style>\n        </noscript>\n\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/favicon-32x32.png\" sizes=\"32x32\">\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/favicon-194x194.png\" sizes=\"194x194\">\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/favicon-96x96.png\" sizes=\"96x96\">\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/android-chrome-192x192.png\" sizes=\"192x192\">\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/favicon-16x16.png\" sizes=\"16x16\">\n        <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/manifest.json\">\n        <link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/safari-pinned-tab.svg\" >\n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n\n        <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"WeGotTickets\">\n        <meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"WeGotTickets\">\n        <meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#ffffff\">\n        <meta name=\"msapplication-TileImage\" content=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/mstile-144x144.png\">\n        <meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/skins/default/images/icons/favicons/browserconfig.xml\">\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#43a6cf\">\n\n        <meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"966242223397117\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://wegottickets.com/f/25577\">\n        <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"events.event\">\n        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"WeGotTickets\">\n        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op presents:\">\n        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op invites you to a fundraising screening of “The Small World of Don Camillo”, directed by Julien Duvivier.\n🔗\nSet in a sleepy town residing in the Po Valley, this beloved classic tells the story of a catholic priest and a communist mayor who discover through quarrel and care what unites them is far greater than what divides them, birthing a genuine reconciliation between faith and communism rooted in a shared commitment to dignity community and liberation. Against this honest solidarity, today there stands a resurgent far right once again cynically co‑opting crosses as an aesthetic shield for cruelty, only together can we expose the fascist masquerade of piety as the hollow lie it is. \n🔗\n&quot;The catholic who is not a revolutionary is living in mortal sin.&quot; - Camilo Torres Restrepo\n🔗\nTo understand this fight we must also understand the language of the land. The Learning Co-op is proud to host both group and 1-1 Italian classes for those keen to learn the language and open new worlds, a form of resistance through education.\nLearn more and book on our website:\nhttps://thelearningcoop.squarespace.com/\n🔗\nJoin us to witness, through the directors’ lens, the reconciliation between Italian communism and the Catholic Church, co-operating as a progressive force for the emancipation of the oppressed in the wake of fascism’s fall.\n🔗\nDate: Thursday 20th August 2026 \nTime: Doors open at 6:30pm \nLocation: 144 Cambridge Heath Rd. Bethnal Green, London, E1 50J, United Kingdom \n🔗\nThis is a ticketed event, we are selling merchandise and accepting further donations on the night, with 50% of funds going going to GMAC and the rest to expanding the learning Co-op's Anti-zionist and radical teaching programs✨️\n🔻🔻🔻\">\n        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://static.wegottickets.com/images/events/6a74aa61703f0_event.jpeg\">\n\n        \n\n        <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n        <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@WeGotTickets\">\n        <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op presents:\">\n        <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op invites you to a fundraising screening of “The Small World of Don Camillo”, directed by Julien Duvivier.\n🔗\nSet in a sleepy town residing in the Po Valley, this...\">\n        <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://static.wegottickets.com/images/events/6a74aa61703f0_event.jpeg\">\n\n        \n        \n    </head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"top\"></div>\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-EYKCLJ1YTB\"></script>\n<script>\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  gtag('js', new Date());\n\n  gtag('config', 'G-EYKCLJ1YTB');\n</script>\n<noscript>\n    <img src=\"//cdn.wegottickets.com/www/images/noscript.gif\" style=\"display: none\" alt=\"noscript\"/>\n</noscript>\n<div id=\"Wrapper\">\n    \n    <div id=\"Header\" class=\"filled\">\n        <div class=\"content\" id=\"LogoNavSearch\">\n            \n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <a href=\"/\">\n                    <img src=\"https://wegottickets.com/skins/default/images/wegottickets_logo_lg_new_no_tagline.webp\" alt=\"WeGotTickets\" />\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"content block-group\" id=\"NavSearch\">\n                <div class=\"content block-group\" id=\"Navigation-container\">\n                    <div id=\"Navigation\">\n                        <div class=\"sub-nav block\">\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>\n    <a id=\"LoginLink\" title=\"Log in\" class=\"login \" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/account\">Log in</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n    <a id=\"Register\" title=\"Register\" class=\"register\" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/register\">Register</a>\n</li>\n\n                                <li>\n                                    <a title=\"Basket\" class=\"basket\" href=\"/basket\">Basket (0)</a>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <a title=\"Ticket your event with WeGotTickets\" href=\"https://clients.wegottickets.com?cc=cs-header\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ticketYourEvent neutral-filled\">Ticket your event</a>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul id=\"mobile-nav\">\n                            <li class=\"css-menu\">\n                                <a class=\"menu-over\">\n                                    <img src=\"https://wegottickets.com/images/hamburger.png\" alt=\"Menu\" title=\"Main menu\"/>\n                                </a>\n                                <a class=\"css-menu-button advance-filled\" tabindex=\"1\" href=\"#\">\n                                    <img src=\"https://wegottickets.com/images/hamburger.png\" alt=\"Menu\" title=\"Main menu\"/>\n                                </a>\n                                <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                                    <li><a title=\"Basket\" id=\"Basket\" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/basket\" class=\"advance-filled\">Basket (0)</a></li>\n                                    <li><a title=\"Ticket your event\" href=\"https://clients.wegottickets.com?cc=cs-header\" target=\"_blank\">Ticket your event</a></li>\n                                    <li>\n    <a id=\"LoginLink\" title=\"Log in\" class=\"login \" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/account\">Log in</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n    <a id=\"Register\" title=\"Register\" class=\"register\" href=\"https://wegottickets.com/register\">Register</a>\n</li>\n\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"content block-group\" id=\"Search-container\">\n            <div class=\"block block-header-search\">\n                <form id=\"search-form\" action=\"/searchresults\" method=\"post\">\n                    <input\n                        class=\"search-form\"\n                        type=\"text\"\n                        name=\"unified_query\"\n                        placeholder=\"Search\"\n                        required\n                    >\n                    <input class=\"button advance-filled search-form\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Search\" aria-label=\"Search\" />\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"filled block-group block-group-flex\" id=\"LinkBlock\">\n        <div class=\"link-block\">\n            <a href=\"/af/664/find/genre/general\">Music</a>\n            <a href=\"/af/664/find/genre/comedy\">Comedy</a>\n            <a href=\"https://wegottickets.tixculture.com/\" target=\"_blank\">West End Theatre</a>\n            <a href=\"/external/token/ajxcjv\" target=\"_blank\">Regional Theatre</a>\n            <a href=\"/af/664/this-weekend\">This Weekend</a>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"WrapperInner\">\n        <div id=\"Page\" class=\"clearfix\">\n            <div id=\"Content\" class=\"clearfix\">\n                <div id=\"extra_content\"></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\":\"Films4Freedom and The Learning Co\\u2011op presents:\",\"description\":\"The Small World of Don Camillo - Films4Freedom and The Learning Co\\u2011op invites you to a fundraising screening of\\u00a0\\u201cThe Small World of Don Camillo\\u201d, directed by Julien Duvivier.\\ud83d\\udd17Set in a sleepy town residing in the Po Valley, this beloved classic tells the story of a catholic priest and a communist mayor who discover through quarrel and care what unites them is far greater than what divides them, birthing a genuine reconciliation between faith and communism rooted in a shared commitment to dignity community and liberation.\\u00a0Against this honest solidarity, today there stands a resurgent far right once again cynically co\\u2011opting crosses as an aesthetic shield for cruelty, only together can we expose the fascist masquerade of piety as the hollow lie it is. \\ud83d\\udd17\\\"The catholic who is not a\\u00a0revolutionary\\u00a0is living in mortal sin.\\\" - Camilo Torres Restrepo\\ud83d\\udd17To understand this fight we must also understand the language of the land. The Learning Co-op is proud to host both group and\\u00a01-1 Italian classes for those keen to learn the language and open new worlds, a form of resistance through education.Learn more and book on our website:https://thelearningcoop.squarespace.com/\\ud83d\\udd17Join us to witness, through the directors\\u2019 lens, the reconciliation between Italian communism and the Catholic Church, co-operating as a progressive force for the emancipation of the oppressed in the wake of fascism\\u2019s fall.\\ud83d\\udd17Date: Thursday 20th August 2026\\u00a0Time: Doors open at 6:30pm\\u00a0Location: 144 Cambridge Heath Rd. Bethnal Green, London, E1 50J, United Kingdom \\ud83d\\udd17This is a ticketed event, we are selling merchandise and accepting further donations on the night, with 50% of funds going going to GMAC and the rest to expanding the learning Co-op's Anti-zionist and radical teaching programs\\u2728\\ufe0f\\ud83d\\udd3b\\ud83d\\udd3b\\ud83d\\udd3b\",\"startDate\":\"2026-08-20T19:00:00+01:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"London Pelican House\",\"address\":\"144 Cambridge Heath Rd Bethnal Green London E1 5QJ\",\"postalCode\":\"E1 5QJ\",\"url\":\"https://www.londonlearningcoop.com/\"},\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"url\":\"https://wegottickets.com/f/25577\",\"image\":\"https://static.wegottickets.com/images/events/6a74aa61703f0_event.jpeg\",\"offers\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"category\":\"Primary\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":5.5,\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://wegottickets.com/f/25577\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"category\":\"Primary\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":16.5,\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://wegottickets.com/f/25577\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"category\":\"Primary\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"price\":3.3,\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://wegottickets.com/f/25577\"}],\"organizer\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Films4Freedom\",\"url\":\"https://Instagram.com/films4freedom\"}]}</script>\n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"block-group\">\n        <div class=\"left block\">\n            <div class=\"event-image left full-width-mobile\"><img src=\"https://static.wegottickets.com/images/events/6a74aa61703f0_event.jpeg\" alt=\"Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op presents:\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"left full-width-mobile event-information event-width\">\n                <a href=\"#tickets\" class=\"right button\" id=\"ticketsButton\">Tickets</a>\n\n                <h1>Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op presents:</h1>\n\n                <p class='subtitle'>The Small World of Don Camillo</p>\n                <p>Presented by: Films4Freedom</p>\n\n                <hr>\n\n                <table class=\"venue-details\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"entypo\" title=\"Location\">0</th>\n                        <td><a href=\"/location/30325\">LONDON: Pelican House</a> <a href=\"#location-30325\">(info)</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"entypo\" title=\"Date\">P</th>\n                        <td>Thursday 20th August, 2026</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"entypo\" title=\"Time\">N</th>\n                        <td>Door time: 6:30pm, start time: 7:00pm</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"entypo\" title=\"Age limit\">.</th>\n                        <td>All ages</td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    \n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"entypo\" title=\"Genre\">C</th>\n                    <td>Film</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                    \n                    \n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"block full-width\">\n                \n    <h2 class=\"stripe-heading\">Event information</h2>\n    <main>Films4Freedom and The Learning Co‑op invites you to a fundraising screening of “The Small World of Don Camillo”, directed by Julien Duvivier.<br>\n🔗<br>\nSet in a sleepy town residing in the Po Valley, this beloved classic tells the story of a catholic priest and a communist mayor who discover through quarrel and care what unites them is far greater than what divides them, birthing a genuine reconciliation between faith and communism rooted in a shared commitment to dignity community and liberation. Against this honest solidarity, today there stands a resurgent far right once again cynically co‑opting crosses as an aesthetic shield for cruelty, only together can we expose the fascist masquerade of piety as the hollow lie it is. <br>\n🔗<br>\n\"The catholic who is not a revolutionary is living in mortal sin.\" - Camilo Torres Restrepo<br>\n🔗<br>\nTo understand this fight we must also understand the language of the land. The Learning Co-op is proud to host both group and 1-1 Italian classes for those keen to learn the language and open new worlds, a form of resistance through education.<br>\nLearn more and book on our website:<br>\nhttps://thelearningcoop.squarespace.com/<br>\n🔗<br>\nJoin us to witness, through the directors’ lens, the reconciliation between Italian communism and the Catholic Church, co-operating as a progressive force for the emancipation of the oppressed in the wake of fascism’s fall.<br>\n🔗<br>\nDate: Thursday 20th August 2026 <br>\nTime: Doors open at 6:30pm <br>\nLocation: 144 Cambridge Heath Rd. Bethnal Green, London, E1 50J, United Kingdom <br>\n🔗<br>\nThis is a ticketed event, we are selling merchandise and accepting further donations on the night, with 50% of funds going going to GMAC and the rest to expanding the learning Co-op's Anti-zionist and radical teaching programs✨️<br>\n🔻🔻🔻</main>\n\n            </div>\n\n            \n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"block-group\">\n        \n    <a id=\"tickets\"></a>\n\n    <h2 class=\"stripe-heading\">Tickets</h2>\n\n    <div id=\"tickets-container\">\n        \n<div class=\"BuyBox block\">\n    <div>\n        <a name=\"rtn_711197\"></a>\n\n        <div class=\"flex full-width mobile-column\">\n            <div class=\"text-top small-full-width medium-60-percent\">\n                <h3>General Admission</h3>\n\n                \n                \n    <p>40 tickets available</p>\n\n\n                <table class=\"venue-details\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"right text-right text-top small-full-width medium-40-percent\">\n                <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"data-style\">Total price: &pound;5.50</span><br>Ticket price: &pound;5.00, Booking fee: &pound;0.50</div>\n                <div class=\"right\">\n                    \n                    \n    <form method=\"post\" action=\"https://wegottickets.com/action\" class=\"fform left\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"type\" value=\"upd\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"fest\" value=\"25577\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"gig\" value=\"711197\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"festpage\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"qty\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"from\" value=\"\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"day\" value=\"\">\n        <input class=\"button buy\" type=\"submit\" name=\"buy\" value=\"Buy\" >\n    </form>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        